# CCS domain 1 (part): inpatient ICD-10-CM principal diagnosis, sequencing and POA; ICD-10-PCS.
# Each item: (stem, key, [3 wrong options], explanation). build.py puts the key in slot i % 4.
# Rules: FY2026 ICD-10-CM Official Guidelines (Sections I, II, III and Appendix I) and FY2026
# ICD-10-PCS Official Guidelines. No CPT descriptors, no code-book look-ups.

